..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PRICEMAINTENANCE.ROUND.ALL
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Iterates rows representing scaled prices and rounds basevalue
.. using the rounding factor. The base value is specified by mask item mpreis the
.. rounding factor by the mask item roundingfactor. The result is written to mask
.. item mpreisneu. A empty rounding factor is ignored, an empty basevalue as well.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Nothing to do
.continue END ? F|empty(M|roundingfactor)
..
.type realx roundingfactor
.type realx basevalue
..
.formula U|roundingfactor = M|roundingfactor
.select screen line 'F|formatstr("$,,;tbaumstufe=(1)", M|rowlevel)'
!BREAK
.continue END ? _G|mehr
.continue NEXTROW ? F|empty(M|mpreis)
.formula U|basevalue = M|mpreis
.input 'M|rounding' ? _F|empty(M|rounding)
.formula M|mpreisneu = U|basevalue
!NEXTROW
.select screen line
.continue BREAK
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
